---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Community"
  description="Join the DistLLM community — contribute code, write guides, and help pool the world's idle GPUs."
>
  <section class="container-site py-14">
    <SectionHeading
      eyebrow="Community"
      title="Built in the open"
      lead="DistLLM is Apache-2.0 open source. Contributors, writers, and testers all welcome."
    />

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl">Contribute code</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
          Good first issues are labeled on GitHub — backends, partitioners, docs, and tests all count.
          The security-critical paths require an adversarial review before merge.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/distributed-llm/distributed-llm/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md"
          target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-brand-700 hover:underline"
        >
          Contributing guide →
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl">Write &amp; teach</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
          Guides for pooling unusual hardware, benchmarking your cluster, or running DistLLM
          in a classroom make great blog posts — PRs to this site welcome.
        </p>
        <a href="/learn/" class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-brand-700 hover:underline">
          Learning hub →
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-7 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="text-xl">Report &amp; test</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted">
          Bug reports with repro steps and benchmark numbers from real clusters are the most
          valuable contributions of all.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/distributed-llm/distributed-llm/issues"
          target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-brand-700 hover:underline"
        >
          Issue tracker →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-[#131a16] p-8 text-center">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Star the project</h3>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-md text-sm text-white/70">
        Stars help other people find DistLLM — if it runs a model your machines couldn't
        handle alone, that's worth one click.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 font-mono text-sm text-white/50">github.com/distributed-llm/distributed-llm</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
